{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103830/extras/2993048a2417473afc2f1803f1ea829f.avif?t=1773573564\" width=600 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><strong>Kitty Finder</strong> is a peaceful hidden object game set in a huge mansion filled with dim lights. Our goal is simple: find the adorable cats hidden in every corner!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes squeezed between couches, sometimes hidden behind bookshelves, and sometimes quietly watching under dim lights, the cats await you. You'll spot some immediately, while others will challenge you with little puzzles. Each cat is waiting for you to reveal them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103830/extras/bc975e42e38878ba06d46178e0e2deee.avif?t=1773573564\" width=600 height=98 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20 unique locations:</strong> Dozens of hidden cats in rooms with different themes, such as under couches, behind bookshelves, and in attics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mini puzzles:</strong> You may need to pass small but fun tests to reach some cats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Peaceful atmosphere:</strong> A completely relaxing experience in dim light, soft music, and a cozy environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Family-friendly content:</strong> Suitable for players of all ages, playable without violence or time pressure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hidden object experience:</strong> Test your observation skills, use your attention, and discover every corner where cats are hiding.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4103830?t=1773573564","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103830/a2229834af66492238b918d4ee5ac7296deec989/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773573564","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103830/29452c1efb3008d3ef7680709c8a28a0bfea598a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773573564","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103830/29452c1efb3008d3ef7680709c8a28a0bfea598a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773573564","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4229430,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103830/extras/2993048a2417473afc2f1803f1ea829f.avif?t=1773573564\" width=600 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><strong>Kitty Finder</strong> is a peaceful hidden object game set in a huge mansion filled with dim lights. Our goal is simple: find the adorable cats hidden in every corner!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes squeezed between couches, sometimes hidden behind bookshelves, and sometimes quietly watching under dim lights, the cats await you. You'll spot some immediately, while others will challenge you with little puzzles. Each cat is waiting for you to reveal them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103830/extras/bc975e42e38878ba06d46178e0e2deee.avif?t=1773573564\" width=600 height=98 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\">